        "description_short": "A pure logic puzzle blending Sudoku & Minesweeper! Find every cat's territory.",
        "description_excerpt": "Looking for a game that soothes the soul but keeps your brain spinning? Welcome to Meowdoku — a pure logic puzzle game that flawlessly blends the rigorous reasoning of Sudoku with the thrilling deduction of Minesweeper.<br>Here, you have only one mission: find the perfect \"exclusive territory\" for every aloof little cat!<br>💡 Simple Rules, Deep Strategy<br>The concept is elegant and intuitive, yet anything but simple:<br>• Exclusive Territory: The board is divided into colored sections. You must place exactly one cat in each section.<br>• The Aloof Rule: Cats need absolute personal space! They absolutely cannot share the same row, column, or touch each other—not even diagonally.<br>• Risk & Reward: Double-tap a tile to place a cat. You only have 3 chances to make a mistake (hearts). Guess right, and you're rewarded with pure puzzle-solving satisfaction; guess wrong, and you lose a heart. Guessing won't save you; every single move must be carefully calculated!<br>✨ Key Features<br>🐾 Pure & Immersive Experience<br>- Non-Intrusive Ads: Zero interruptions to your gameplay, letting you fully enjoy a completely focused, Zen-like flow state.<br>- Play Offline Anytime: No internet requi...",
